 "manifest": {
  "_id": "@codingmantra/mcp-server",
  "_rev": "6-282582fa85706206facbd078dfdc5342",
  "description": "Official Model Context Protocol (MCP) Server for CodingMantra AI Generation Tools",
  "dist-tags": {
   "latest": "0.2.0"
  },
  "maintainers": [
   {
    "email": "[redacted-email:73d88376badf]",
    "name": "codingmantra"
   }
  ],
  "name": "@codingmantra/mcp-server",
  "readme": "# @codingmantra/mcp-server\n\nThe official **Model Context Protocol (MCP)** server connecting AI assistants (Claude Desktop, Cursor, Cline, and Antigravity) to CodingMantra's generative AI media engines.\n\n## What's New in v0.2.0\n- \ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f **Native MCP Image Output**: Generated images (including QR codes, logos, try-on shots, and product photos) return standard MCP `ImageContent` so they render directly in your AI assistant's chat window.\n- \ud83d\udcc1 **Local File Path Resolution**: Pass local paths (e.g. `./shoe.png` or `/Users/.../portrait.jpg`) directly in tool arguments\u2014the server automatically reads and encodes them as base64 data URIs.\n- \u26a1 **Expanded Tool Suite (20 Tools)**: Added support for Jewelry Try-On, Apparel Try-On, Product Try-On, Festival Posts, YouTube Thumbnails, Passport Photos, Sketch-to-Real, Upscaling, Wallet Credit Checking, and Model Catalog discovery.\n- \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f **Graceful Error Handling & 120s Timeout**: Informative error diagnostics when API keys are missing or requests time out, with clean stdio protocol execution.\n\n---\n\n## Features & Tool Suite\n\nThe server exposes **20 specialized generative and utility tools** over standard I/O (`stdio`):\n\n### 1. Synchronous Image Generation (Immediate Inline Image Output)\n- **`generate_product_photo`** \u2014 Generates studio-grade commercial product photos with custom background scenes, ambient occlusion contact shadows, Hasselblad camera optics, resolutions (1K, 2K, 4K), aspect ratios, and dynamic logo/text overlays.\n- **`generate_logo`** \u2014 Generates bespoke vector-style or 3D brand logos with customizable typography, colors, industries, and reference images.\n- **`try_on_jewelry`** \u2014 Virtual luxury jewelry try-on with model styling, metal & gemstone preservation, Fresnel light dispersion, and anatomical contact shadows.\n- **`try_on_apparel`** \u2014 Virtual fashion apparel try-on with natural gravitational folds, realistic fabric tension, Hasselblad medium-format camera optics, and ground contact shadows.\n- **`try_on_product`** \u2014 Universal commercial product staging and virtual try-on across footwear, accessories, cosmetics, eyewear, and furniture with 3-point studio lighting.\n- **`generate_festival_post`** \u2014 High-conversion festival marketing graphics, holiday greetings (Diwali, Eid, Christmas, New Year), and promotional banners with product and logo integration.\n- **`generate_youtube_thumbnail`** \u2014 High-CTR YouTube thumbnails with rule-of-thirds composition, emotional human expressions, vibrant contrast separation, and legible bold text overlays.\n- **`generate_passport_photo`** \u2014 Converts any portrait into an official, compliant passport or visa identity photo with pixel-level facial identity preservation.\n- **`sketch_to_real`** \u2014 Transforms hand-drawn sketches, line drawings, or product drafts into photorealistic commercial images while preserving ground-truth silhouettes.\n- **`upscale_image`** \u2014 Upscales and enhances any image with AI detail recovery, removing compression artifacts and increasing resolution up to 4K.\n\n### 2. QR Code Tools\n- **`generate_qr_code`** \u2014 Full-featured custom QR code generator supporting URLs, plain text, Wi-Fi credentials, vCards, emails, and UPI payment strings with custom styling, colors, and error correction.\n- **`generate_qr_code_simple`** \u2014 Lightweight single-parameter QR code generation from text or URL.\n\n### 3. Account & Discovery Utilities\n- **`get_user_credits`** \u2014 Checks your current CodingMantra AI wallet credit balance in real time.\n- **`list_image_models`** \u2014 Queries all available CodingMantra AI image generation models (Gemini Flash, Pro, Flux, etc.), supported resolutions, aspect ratios, and credit costs.\n\n### 4. Asynchronous Video Tools (with Job Polling)\n- **`generate_product_video`** \u2014 Commercial product videography (Google Veo 3.1 & OpenRouter Wan 2.7).\n- **`generate_apparel_video`** \u2014 Model runway and apparel try-on video showcase.\n- **`generate_festival_video`** \u2014 Festive event greetings and celebratory motion graphics.\n- **`generate_jewelry_video`** \u2014 High-end luxury jewelry videography with realistic optical brilliance dispersion.\n- **`generate_logo_video`** \u2014 3D logo reveal and motion graphic intros.\n- **`check_video_job_status`** \u2014 Real-time polling tool to track background video rendering status (`queued` \u2192 `processing` \u2192 `generating` \u2192 `uploading` \u2192 `completed` / `failed`).\n\nAll generations automatically deduct credits from your CodingMantra wallet and persist outputs directly to your online media gallery at [https://codingmantra.com/my-gallery](https://codingmantra.com/my-gallery).\n\n---\n\n## Quick Setup\n\n### 1. Obtain Your API Key\nGenerate an API key from your [CodingMantra Dashboard \u2192 My API Keys](https://codingmantra.com/my-api).\n\n### 2. Configure Your AI Client\n\n#### A. Claude Desktop\nAdd to your `claude_desktop_config.json`:\n- **macOS:** `~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json`\n- **Windows:** `%APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json`\n\n```json\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"codingmantra\": {\n      \"command\": \"npx\",\n      \"args\": [\"-y\", \"@codingmantra/mcp-server@latest\"],\n      \"env\": {\n        \"CODINGMANTRA_API_KEY\": \"YOUR_CODINGMANTRA_API_KEY\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### B. Cursor\nAdd to `.cursor/mcp.json` in your project or global settings:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"codingmantra\": {\n      \"command\": \"npx\",\n      \"args\": [\"-y\", \"@codingmantra/mcp-server@latest\"],\n      \"env\": {\n        \"CODINGMANTRA_API_KEY\": \"YOUR_CODINGMANTRA_API_KEY\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### C. Cline (VS Code Extension)\nIn Cline Settings \u2192 MCP Servers, add:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"codingmantra\": {\n    \"command\": \"npx\",\n    \"args\": [\"-y\", \"@codingmantra/mcp-server@latest\"],\n    \"env\": {\n      \"CODINGMANTRA_API_KEY\": \"YOUR_CODINGMANTRA_API_KEY\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### D. Antigravity / Agentic Workspace\nAdd to `.agents/mcp_config.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"codingmantra\": {\n      \"command\": \"npx\",\n      \"args\": [\"-y\", \"@codingmantra/mcp-server@latest\"],\n      \"env\": {\n        \"CODINGMANTRA_API_KEY\": \"YOUR_CODINGMANTRA_API_KEY\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Example Natural Language Prompts\n\nOnce configured, restart your AI assistant and try prompts like:\n\n- *\"How many credits do I have left in my CodingMantra account?\"*\n- *\"Generate a luxury product photo of this perfume bottle on a dark reflective obsidian pedestal with subtle mist.\"*\n- *\"Virtually try on this diamond necklace on an elegant editorial model wearing a black velvet evening gown.\"*\n- *\"Create a YouTube thumbnail for my video 'Top 10 AI Tools of 2026' with bold text and high contrast.\"*\n- *\"Create a modern minimalist geometric logo for a fintech company called 'Acuity'.\"*\n- *\"Generate a UPI payment QR code for merchant@upi with an amount of 500.\"*\n- *\"Create a 4-second jewelry video showing this diamond ring rotating on a black velvet pedestal with cinematic sunbeam flares, and check its progress until it's finished.\"*\n\n---\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n| Variable | Required | Description | Default |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `CODINGMANTRA_API_KEY` | \u2705 | Your CodingMantra developer API key (`cm_...`) | None |\n| `CODINGMANTRA_API_URL` | \u274c | Custom API base URL | `https://codingmantra.com/api` |\n\n---\n\n## Local Development\n\n```bash\n# Build TypeScript\nnpm run build\n\n# Start server directly on stdio\nCODINGMANTRA_API_KEY=your_key node build/index.js\n```\n\n## License\n\nPrivate & Proprietary \u2014 Part of the CodingMantra Web Portal \u00a9 2026. All rights reserved.\n",
